<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 0-0 V (INDIA 410) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 0-0 V (INDIA 410) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 0-0 in reply to India's first innings of 410 at the close on the second day of the third and final test at the Wanderers on Friday.</p>
</text>
